{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2023-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1694131200, "end_date": 1694822399, "month_true_total": 95, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:52:34 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "146360144", "author": {"steamid": "76561198247185392", "personaname": "keaston0", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198247185392/", "num_games_owned": 218, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 6820, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6042, "last_played": 1757364807, "avatar": "3a85551004fa17fce661a652c5b77971c5b3cdc8"}, "language": "english", "review": "game good and looks good", "timestamp_created": 1694813213, "timestamp_updated": 1694813213, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "146333982", "author": {"steamid": "76561198122147034", "personaname": "Pete", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Pet3FPS/", "num_games_owned": 84, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 6968, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3990, "last_played": 1707073306, "avatar": "25c25e7874648b6ee52efb86961b9ad070cd2a8d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Easy to recommend, one of the best roguelike games there is. \n\nI played the early access and now the closed beta which is 99,9% the final product. \nIf you like movement shooters I recommend giving this game a shot. One pretty similar game is Gunfire Reborn. \n\nGameplay itself is very fun and engaging. The movement is really really smooth - I never thought a game could feel smoothe gameplay wise than Apex Legends but this one takes the cake. \nThroughout progressing, you unlock gadgets which increase the movement and verticality even further, bringing in new ways to play this game. \n\nAll in all this is fast paced movement shooter which I personally really enjoy. Good job by the developers.", "timestamp_created": 1694783423, "timestamp_updated": 1694783423, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "146293295", "author": {"steamid": "76561198803055725", "personaname": "Chad King", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hasslepack/", "num_games_owned": 143, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3072, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1586, "last_played": 1741136255, "avatar": "56f38b91a890f8456172fe7cb99d8f8dc72892a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't know what to say other than if you like games like Gunfire Reborn or Risk of Rain 2 you will absolutely love this game it has plenty of cool weapons and fast paced movement as well as augments to switch up your play style, there is always something new to find. This game is a must play for rouge lite fans.", "timestamp_created": 1694714817, "timestamp_updated": 1694714817, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "146279665", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045143642", "personaname": "Harry", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TonyPlease/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 2985, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1823, "last_pl